 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Where are you going?",
   "texto": [
    "To say where you are going, **в** or **на** is used with the accusative: **в библиотеку** (to the library), **в бассейн** (to the pool), **на стадион** (to the stadium), **на почту** (to the post).",
    "feminine in **-а** change to **-у**: **библиотека** → **библиотеку**, **почта** → **почту**. In these inanimate destinations, the masculine and neutrals retain their form: **в бассейн**, **на стадион**, **на занятие**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "With «на» or «в»",
   "texto": [
    "With **на** many service or activity sites are used: **на почту**, **на стадион**, **на занятие** (class). With **в** many buildings are used: **в библиотеку**, **в бассейн**, **в поликлинику** (to the clinic). It is an orientation: the combination depends on the usual use of each site.",
    "To say where you are, the prepositional is used: **в библиотеке** (in the library), **на почте** (in post)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Time Expression",
   "texto": [
    "**В субботу** (Saturday) indicates when you are going; it does not express a destination."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The verb идти",
   "texto": [
